1. Definitions

"Software" means the files in the ee/ directory of the HexProcure repository,
in source or object form, and any copy, modification or derivative work of
them. "Licence Key" means a signed token issued by the Licensor that names a
Tier and a validity period and is verified by the check in src/lib/license.ts.
"Tier" means a feature tier named in the feature map in ee/features.ts.
"Production Use" means any use of the Software other than evaluation,
development, testing or contribution, including use for your own business
operations or for your customers. "You" means the business that accepts this
licence.

2. Who may accept this licence, and how

The Software is offered only to persons acting in the course of their trade,
business, craft or profession (entrepreneurs within the meaning of Sections
420(1) and 421 of Act No. 89/2012 Coll., the Czech Civil Code). It is not
offered to consumers. By copying, modifying or using the Software You accept
this licence on behalf of the business You act for and confirm that You are
authorised to bind it. This is an offer to an indeterminate circle of persons
that is accepted by that conduct, without notice to the Licensor (Section 2373
of the Civil Code).

3. Free grant: view, modify, test and contribute

The Licensor grants You a non-exclusive, territorially unlimited, free of
charge licence to view, copy, modify and test the Software, and to send
contributions to the Licensor, for the purposes of evaluation, development,
testing and contribution. This grant needs no Licence Key and carries no
remuneration.

4. Production Use needs a Licence Key

Production Use of the Software is permitted only while You hold a valid
Licence Key for the Tier that covers each feature You use, and only for the
validity period and within the limits stated in the Licence Key. The
remuneration for Production Use is the fee agreed in the order or invoice
under which the Licensor issued the Licence Key. A Licence Key is issued to
one licensee, is non-transferable and may not be shared, lent, resold or
offered to third parties. Production Use without a valid Licence Key, or of a
feature outside the Tier named in the Licence Key, is a breach of this
licence.

5. No circumvention

You may not remove, disable, weaken or work around the licence check in
